"""
Trust-loop hardening tests (learning/trust_guard.py).

Three opt-in, default-off mechanisms: read-time decay toward neutral,
min-interaction gate, and detect-only positive-signal-burst /
single-source-domination flagging. Stored trust_score values are NEVER
mutated -- flag-off behavior must be byte-equivalent to the unguarded
scaffold, pinned by the regression tests here.

Library-level suite: runs in ALL profiles (learning + orchestration are
never profile-gated). The gateway-route variants live in test_api.py.
"""

